// Villain Def - Clockwork_Sprocket 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3968039773" "These pint-sized junkyard contraptions have become a real plague on the streets of certain neighborhoods. Their exact workings are mysterious, but there's no mystery about the deadly bolts of electricity they hurl at anyone who gets in their way."
// DisplayNames :
"P764994010" "Sprocket"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Clockwork_Summoned_Sprocket 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3157158168" "Cog"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Clockwork_Summoned_Sprocket_Babbage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
