// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Pistol_Scientist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3946266419" "Crey Industries believes firmly in hands on, frontline research, and they demand more from their scientists than most companies. Indeed, Crey Scientists often venture into the field, armed with Cryo weapons to help them collect samples - and do serious damage to anyone who get in their way."
// DisplayNames :
"P1629505710" "Research Assistant"

