// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Secret_Agent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1955035359" "The stone-faced, suit clad Field Agents are Crey's main investigative branch. They can be found carrying out a variety of missions, from espionage to assassination ops. They carry the latest weapons and receive intense close combat training."
// DisplayNames :
"P2953123233" "Field Agent"

