"P986320000" "Infiltrator"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Infiltrator_Agent_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Cryo_Scientist_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1934178330" "The leaders of every Crey research team receive special training in leadership, tactics, and combat techniques. They also have access to the latest advanced weaponry, making them especially dangerous."
// DisplayNames :
"P3662831080" "Chief Cryo Scientist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Flame_Scientist_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1818604460" "Chief Plasma Scientist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Agent_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1425280075" "The leaders of Crey's security teams are experts at identifying threats and picking them off from a distance. With the latest in advanced assault weaponry at their disposal, these agents are a force to be reckoned with."
// DisplayNames :
"P3021396201" "Elite Security Agent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Agent_Lt_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Melee_Agent_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2613383461" "The Special Agents are the best of Crey's field operatives. They have superb training, the best weapons, and a seemingly preternatural focus on the task at hand. They often carry heavy weapons, since Crey trusts them enough to use them discreetly and appropriately."
// DisplayNames :
"P321722298" "Special Agent Vigilant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Melee_Agent_Lt_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Infiltrator_Agent_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P556248289" "Special Agent Infiltrator"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Infiltrator_Agent_Lt_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Agent_Sniper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P416325435" "Special Agent Sharpshooter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Agent_Sniper_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Chaingun_Armored_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3184305606" "With their heavy chain guns and advanced training, these armor clad leaders carry enough firepower to stop a tank. They're also almost as hard to hurt, though they are vulnerable to mental assaults."
// DisplayNames :
"P1224978489" "Crey Eliminator"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Grenade_Armored_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P7337719" "Crey sends these specialized units to handle big problems.  Their grenade launchers can fire a variety of munitions, making them well-equipped to handle any situation.  These armor clad leaders carry enough firepower to stop a tank. They're also almost as hard to hurt, though they are vulnerable to mental assaults."
// DisplayNames :
"P140804187" "Crey Crisis Unit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Missile_Armored_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1763516996" "With their powerful personal force fields, missile launchers, and advanced training, these armor clad leaders carry enough firepower to stop a tank. They're also almost as hard to hurt, though they are vulnerable to mental assaults."
// DisplayNames :
"P3229861433" "Crey Juggernaut"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3964245958" "10...9...8...7...6...5..."
// DisplayNames :
"P1962093241" "Time Bomb"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Armored_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3525472467" "With their powerful force fields, heavy weapons, and advanced training, these armor clad leaders carry enough firepower to stop a tank. They're also almost as hard to hurt, though they are vulnerable to mental assaults."
// DisplayNames :
"P1253422584" "Crey Protector"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Crey_Electric_Tank 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P979140668" "Crey's perfected Voltaic Armor can turn any soldier into the proverbial irresistible force.  Voltaic Tanks can generate almost limitless electrical current, which they can hurl at great distances."
// DisplayNames :
"P241136354" "Crey Voltaic Tank"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Crey_Ice_Tank 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3287181224" "Crey's perfected Cryo Armor can turn any soldier into the proverbial irresistible force. Cooled with liquid nitrogen, the Cryo Tanks can absorb almost limitless heat and hurl great chunks of ice at their foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P680886235" "Crey Cryo Tank"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Crey_Power_Tank 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1891821412" "Crey's perfected Power Armor can turn any soldier into the proverbial irresistible force.  Power Tanks can generate almost limitless power, which they can hurl at great distances."
// DisplayNames :
"P3312275415" "Crey Power Tank"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Claw_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4275031387" "Crey denies the rumors that the Paragon Protectors are corporate pawns, but no one outside the company knows the truth for sure. The Claw Pattern hero is a master of melee combat, using both claws and enhanced physical attributes to make mincemeat of his or her opponents."
// DisplayNames :
"P3386713781" "Paragon Protector"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Claw_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Power_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P303851821" "No one knows who these helmet clad heroes are, or where they come from. The only thing that's certain is their loyalty to Crey. The Power Paragon Protectors can generate powerful blasts of energy in both melee and ranged combat situations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Power_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Electric_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3122966020" "Know to the masses as 'The Shining Light', Vivian Tucker used to be one of Paragon City's most courageous heroes. But after one too many encounters with Crey, she's not who she used to be. No one can say for certain whether this new Vivian is the result of Crey's insidious mind control or their grotesque Revenant Hero Project. Only one thing is clear: she's fighting on Crey's side now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Quills_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P255583983" "The Paragon Protectors keep their names and faces a secret. That way, their good deeds all get credited to Crey, while their less virtuous activities can be plausibly denied in court. The Quill Pattern heroes use a variety of deadly ranged and melee attacks to fill their enemies with holes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hero_Clone_Quills_Boss_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Hopkins 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3999366698" "Hopkins is the devoted servant and bodyguard of the mysterious Countess Crey. Since the day he was hired, he's been at her side constantly, rarely venturing outside the range of her voice.  Hopkins is clearly the second in command in the Crey hierarchy."
// DisplayNames :
"P1940610850" "Hopkins"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Countess_Crey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2425134020" "Countess Crey runs her corporation with an iron fist. Though others hold the lofty title of president and CEO, everyone understands that this is just a legal fiction. The countess is the one holding the strings behind the vast corporation - and woe to anyone who gets in her way."
// DisplayNames :
"P1587165600" "Countess Crey"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Nictus_Hunter_Agent 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3165602323" "Quantum Agent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Nictus_Hunter_Agent_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Nictus_Hunter_Agent_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1153086155" "Elite Quantum Agent"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Nictus_Hunter_Agent_Lt_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Nictus_Hunter_Tank_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1419898104" "Crey Quantum Tank"

