"P3872804317" "The Fungi emit spores that strengthen the immunity of Devouring Earth creatures. As a result, nearby creatures become resistant to many effects, including knockdown, sleep, disorient, and stun."
// DisplayNames :
"P300665068" "Fungi"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarth_Cairin 
