// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3899187939" "No one knows exactly how Hamidon breathed life into this colossal tree. What is certain is that the tree is grateful. Thorn defends Hamidon's Eden with a fearsome vigor, and seems to have no sympathy for anything that walks on two legs."
// DisplayNames :
"P28023500" "Thorn"

