// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P31564636" "This giant crystal monster may be the most beautiful of Hamidon's strange creations. It is also one of the deadliest. Lattice will happily slaughter any human being who sets foot within Hamidon's bizarre paradise."
// DisplayNames :
"P23998548" "Lattice"

