// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Nictus_Hunter_Freaks 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3311986493" "Freak Quantum_Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Freakshow_Nicti_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P951984386" "The Freakshow as a group display a twisted kind of Darwinism in action. Only the strong have any privileges, and all the weak try to get stronger. Most do this by abusing Excelsior and cybernetics, but some try other methods regardless of the danger. These Freaks have turned to Arakhn's new N-Fragment technology, granting them some small amount of Nictus power."
// DisplayNames :
"P1010495887" "Shadow Freak"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Freakshow_Nicti_Juicer_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3816580287" "Most Juicers are already living on a constant power-fed edge, but some seek to push it farther still. By accepting Arakhn's new N-Fragment technology, they've pushed the limits even further, mixing their endless electricity fueled rush with the alien energy of the Nictus."
// DisplayNames :
"P50397678" "Shadow Juicer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Freakshow_Nicti_Tank_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1043001905" "For some Tank Freaks, turning their bodies into nightmarish steel-jacketed engines of destruction is enough, but for others it's only the beginning. They seek out any new technology they can find to make themselves more powerful and less human. The Shadow Tank Freak has turned to Arakhn's N-Fragment technology, adding Nictus abilities to their already formidable powers."
// DisplayNames :
"P1171063024" "Shadow Tank Freak"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Sonic_Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3861915102" "This sonic device could deliver quite a blast if it detonates. You'll have to destroy it first."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P2816801586" "Sonic Bomb"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Blahpunk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3637005415" "The Blahpunks' sonic implants have made them a new kind of threat. You have to wonder where they obtained the technology."
// GroupDescription :
"P1115293490" "Freakshow"
// DisplayNames :
"P813508805" "Blahpunk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Freakshow_Freakshow_Noise_Tank 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P985055525" "The Noise Tanks' sonic implants have made them a new kind of threat. You have to wonder where they obtained the technology."
// DisplayNames :
"P1201346240" "Noise Tank"

