// Villain Def - Hellions_Brawl_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2464635126" "The Hellions have found their special edge by using the power of mystical artifacts to increase their strength and skill. Only the highest ranked gang members know where these artifacts really come from. The gang values secrecy and solidarity; only those who have undergone the initiation ritual and ceremonially cut themselves can be called Blood Brothers."
// DisplayNames :
"P1051174363" "Blood Brother Brawler"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hellions_Knife_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1567135139" "Blood Brother Slicer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
