// DisplayNames :
"P4172582022" "Blood Brother Slammer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hellions_Axe_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P222712670" "Blood Brother Chopper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hellions_Shotgun_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4114293884" "In the satanic worldview of the Hellions, falling is a good thing. The Fallen have proven their willingness to take on any power the gang's mystic artifacts can give them, no matter how twisted or base. The hellfire that burns within them protects them from fire but leaves them susceptible to cold."
// DisplayNames :
"P3294910994" "Fallen Buckshot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hellions_SubmachineGun_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P814234607" "Fallen Gunner"

