// DisplayDescription :
"P3962143360" "The hellfire burns bright inside the leaders of the Hellions. So bright, in fact, that they can call it forth to incinerate their enemies. This inner fire keeps them safe from fire damage, but leaves them quite susceptible to cold."
// DisplayNames :
"P1477002355" "Damned"

