// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Melee_Tentacle_Large 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Ranged_Tentacle_Large 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Man 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1575320706" "These formless creatures appear to be controlled by some other entity. Studies of their remains have revealed that they lack any sort of brain. Nevertheless, their actions demonstrate a fearsome cunning and a total hatred of mankind."
// DisplayNames :
"P1372578019" "Spawn"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Lieutenant_Man 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P120883665" "Some of the creatures found in the sewers are endowed with greater power than their fellows. They don't, however, seem to have any control over the weaker spawn. One thing has been shown; the genetic material of these creatures is unlike anything on this planet."
// DisplayNames :
"P2677821990" "Protean"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Boss_Man 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3269962007" "The Men O' War are the strongest of the strange amoeba-like men that dwell within the sewers. Recently, scientists examined some DNA from a captured Man O' War. Strangely, it contained the genetic code of viruses and plants that are common on Earth."
// DisplayNames :
"P1338600644" "Man O' War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Kraken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3937966746" "The Kraken appears to be a mutation of the strange Hydra Spawn that live in the sewers. For unknown reasons, it stalks the streets of Perez Park. The Kraken is quite powerful and can destroy full teams of heroes without effort."
// DisplayNames :
"P584552377" "Kraken"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Head 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1646893325" "The alien Rikti created the Hydra to guard their secret bases beneath the city. It seems programmed to attack anything that isn't Rikti. Heroes must stop this creature from growing any larger and threatening the city as a whole."
// DisplayNames :
"P3505660613" "Hydra"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_Sewer_Trial_Kraken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2004539743" "The recently Hatched Kraken appears to be a mutation of the strange Hydra Spawn that live in the sewers. The Hatched Kraken is quite powerful and can destroy full teams of heroes without effort."
// DisplayClassName :
// DisplayNames :
"P1116332225" "Hatched Kraken"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Hydra_HydraPod 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3172745248" "This generator seems to serve two purposes. It not only keeps the Hydra safe from all attacks, but also appears to keep the fearsome creature under Rikti control."
// GroupDescription :
"P4183855856" "Rikti"
// DisplayNames :
"P880051107" "Force Field Generator Pod"

