// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Pets_Ambassador_Alwani 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2224078073" "Ambassador Alwani hails from the small country of West Libertalia. If you don't get him out of here, the Sky Raiders will assassinate him."
// GroupDescription :
"P2315246880" "Diplomat"
// DisplayNames :
"P2414583843" "Ambassador Alwani"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Pets_The_American_Ambassador 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1452632540" "This American ambassador wasn't looking for trouble when he went to meet Ambassador Alwani of West Libertalia. If you can't get him out of here, he'll probably be killed to cover up the assassination of Alwani."
// DisplayNames :
"P549873986" "The American Diplomat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Pets_General_Z 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
