// Villain Def - Rikti_RiktiSword_Mutate_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1905968261" "Mutates are fearsome, dedicated fighters, and their leaders, the Headmen, prefer to be in the thick of the fighting. Headmen have more advanced mutations than their followers, and they're not afraid to charge into combat with anyone who stands in their path."
// DisplayNames :
"P3175601183" "Headman Swordsman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_RiktiPistol_Mutate_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2668825739" "Mutates are fearsome, dedicated fighters, and their leaders prefer to by in the thick of the fighting. With their mutations more advanced than normal mutates, they are not afraid to charge into hand-to-hand combat with anyone that stands in their path."
// DisplayNames :
"P1851734116" "Headman Blaster"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_RiktiRifle_Mutate_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1734527580" "Mutates are fearsome, dedicated fighters, and their leaders, the Headmen, prefer to by in the thick of the fighting. Headmen have more advanced mutations than their followers, and they're not afraid to charge into combat with anyone who stands in their path."
// DisplayNames :
"P1691768604" "Headman Rifleman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Anathema_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1444520536" "The Anathema are members of the Lost who have undergone substantial mutation, becoming huge creatures that are barely recognizable as humans. They engage their foes with an unnatural brutality, using whatever weaponry they can find."
// DisplayNames :
"P3457032785" "Anathema"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Rector_Anathema_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P820465221" "The leaders of the Anathema have fully mutated minds that allow them to project their indomitable will onto others. They can use these powers to immobilize, hypnotize, or even dominate lesser wills. The Rectors are the masters of one-on-one conversions; their persuasive abilities work best on a single target."
// DisplayNames :
"P3476113588" "Aberrant Rector"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Eremite_Anathema_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2076149074" "The leaders of the Anathema have fully mutated minds that allow them to project their indomitable will onto others. They can use these powers to immobilize, hypnotize, or even dominate lesser wills. The Eremites are the preachers of the Lost. Their psychic abilities allow them to entrance crowds of possible converts."
// DisplayNames :
"P1865783909" "Aberrant Eremite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Prelate_Pariah_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3307301235" "The most fully mutated Lost, the Pariahs no longer bear any resemblance to the humans they once were. They've become true monsters, although it's not their claws you should fear - it's their prodigious psychic powers, which can rend an opponent's mind faster than any claw can tear flesh."
// DisplayNames :
"P2622903610" "Pariah Prelate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Anchorite_Pariah_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4065706285" "Pariah Anchorite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Monkey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2451226618" "Often referred to as ruin monkeys, these horrible creatures were created by the Rikti, then let loose in the city to wreak havoc. They roam in packs and pounce with tremendous speed and ferocity. Unfortunately, the Rikti seem to have a never-ending supply of them."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
// DisplayNames :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Rikti_Rikti_Drone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1319497021" "During the Rikti War these flying Drones swarmed all over the city's skies. Today these machines still sweep through the air with some frequency. Their quick evasive maneuvering, sophisticated scanners and powerful energy cannon make them a constant menace."
// DisplayNames :
"P793394784" "Drone"
// DisplayNames :
"P1609322064" "Improved Drone"
// DisplayNames :
"P983314852" "Advanced Drone"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
