// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1852650888" "The Rikti have come to stand for everything humans hate and fear in the universe. Their unprovoked invasion of Earth has left much of the planet traumatized and angry. Even out of their battle armor, their high-tech weaponry makes Rikti dangerous opponents."
