// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_Brawl_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P257459419" "Organized crime has always had plenty of competition in Paragon City, but that doesn't stop young street toughs from wanting to swear allegiance to their Don and live like a wiseguy. It helps to be a stone cold killer with a gun, like these guys."
// DisplayNames :
"P2613770530" "Button Man Muscle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_Shotgun_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2099497100" "Button Man Buckshot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_SubmachineGun_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3270244571" "Button Man Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_Muscle_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P331094271" "Each Capo controls his own crew of Button Men. It's a kind of authority you don't earn unless you've proven yourself both ruthless and lucky. Capos save the best weapons and women for themselves and are inevitably smart, tough fighters."
// DisplayNames :
"P1772246120" "Capo Muscle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_AssaultRifle_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P813913489" "Capo Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_Underboss_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3372487063" "The Underbosses report directly to the Don, and each has control over a number of Capos. In Paragon City, you don't rise to the top without a little super-powered help, and many Underbosses have heightened abilities or access to specialized gear that helps them stay on top in their cutthroat business."
// DisplayNames :
"P2697289352" "Underboss"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - TheFamily_Consigliere_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P806421895" "In Paragon City, you don't become one of the Don's trusted advisors without a little super-powered expertise. Consiglieres have far more subtle powers than their Underboss counterparts, which match their more subtle responsibilities within the Family."
// DisplayNames :
"P3443642051" "Consigliere"

