"P4116380861" "The enchanted inks used in Tsoo tattoos grant these soldiers special powers. The yellow ink enhances a Tsoo's mental powers, giving him the ability to dominate and entrance his opponents. Green Ink Men can easily render their victims vulnerable to attack."
