"P567581038" "Mortificator Quantum Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Vahzilok_Nictus_Hunter_Eidolon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P116994314" "In Dr. Vahzilok's mind, the Eidolons are mankind's next great evolutionary leap. Unlike the cadavers, they retain all of their memories and personality. The lucky few who can pay to become a Eidolon are augmented with the remains of heroes, so they often have super powers. Quantum Eidolons have mastered the ability to control darkness itself. They tend to root their foes with tendrils of darkness and then launch into an attack."
// DisplayNames :
"P2837908791" "Quantum Eidolon"

